<title>HONG KONG: Wing Shan 1996 profit down 5.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Wing Shan 1996 profit down 5.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.8   vs  15.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.5    vs  4.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    73.71  vs  78.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		     316.42 vs  339.62</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing Shan International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 16-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 11</p>
<p>NOTE - Wing Shan is a property and power plant company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is five H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs six cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
